/**

\mainpage Fl_Dock Programming Manual

Fl_Dock is an extension to the Fast Light Tool Kit, FLTK 1.4 and later, for
docking panels: an application's panels can be arranged side by side,
stacked as tabs, floated in windows of their own or slid out from stripes
along the window's edges, by dragging them, and the arrangement saved and
restored.

  - \subpage intro
  - \subpage design
  - \subpage examples

The classes are Fl_Dock, Fl_Dock_Panel, Fl_Dock_Split, Fl_Dock_Tabs,
Fl_Dock_Window and Fl_Dock_Stripe.

Fl_Dock is provided under the terms of the FLTK license, the GNU Library
General Public License with exceptions; see the file COPYING.

*/
